    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I Need Some Space is a cosmic adventure that spans multiple genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life in the far future has proved too overwhelming. On a whim, you purchase a caravan from an obscure forum on the interwebs, kissing the interplanetary corporate life goodbye. The caravan, however, seems to be filled with intricate puzzles waiting to be solved...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Painstakingly crafted 3D models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Achievements</p></li></ul>",
